<resources>

    <!--
        German.

        Terminology held to throughout:
        · «Chips» are the physical tokens, «Bargeld» the real money. Keeping those apart is the
          app's central hazard and matters as much here as in English.
        · «Bank» is the bank that issues and buys back chips; the pot stays «Pot».
        · «Small Blind», «Big Blind», «Buy-in», «Rebuy» and «Stack» are kept in English, as
          German-speaking players use them.
        · Field names arrive as arguments inside error messages, so those messages are phrased
          with a colon («Small Blind: Pflichtfeld») rather than agreeing with the noun's gender,
          which the app cannot know.
    -->

